### 1. Crear usuario (201) — el rol del body se ignora
POST http://localhost:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana Pérez", "email": "ANA@mail.com", "password": "clave12345", "rol": "admin" }

### 2. Mismo email (409 EMAIL_DUPLICATED)
POST http://localhost:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana 2", "email": "ana@mail.com", "password": "clave12345" }

### 3. Body inválido (400, con 3 errores en details)
POST http://localhost:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "A", "email": "no-es-email", "password": "123" }

### 4. Listar (200)
GET http://localhost:8000/users

### 5. Obtener uno (200)
GET http://localhost:8000/users/1

### 6. Inexistente (404 USER_NOT_FOUND)
GET http://localhost:8000/users/99

### 7. ID inválido (400)
GET http://localhost:8000/users/abc

### 8. Actualizar nombre (200)
PUT http://localhost:8000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana María" }

### 9. Actualizar con body vacío (400)
PUT http://localhost:8000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 10. Eliminar (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/users/1

### 11. Login admin (200) — guarda el token
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@gestor.com", "password": "TU_ADMIN_PASSWORD" }

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

### 12. Login con contraseña incorrecta (401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS)
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@gestor.com", "password": "incorrecta" }

### 13. Login con email inexistente (401, el MISMO error)
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nadie@gestor.com", "password": "incorrecta" }

### 14. Registro público (201) — el rol sale "usuario" aunque mandes "admin"
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana", "email": "ana@mail.com", "password": "clave12345", "rol": "admin" }

### 15. Login de Ana — guarda su token
# @name loginAna
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@mail.com", "password": "clave12345" }

###
@anaToken = {{loginAna.response.body.$.token}}

### 16. Mi perfil sin token (401 TOKEN_MISSING)
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/me

### 17. Mi perfil con token (200)
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### 18. Token alterado (401 TOKEN_INVALID): cambiá una letra del token
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}x

### 19. Usuario común pide /users (403 FORBIDDEN)
GET http://localhost:8000/users
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### 20. Admin pide /users (200)
GET http://localhost:8000/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 21. Admin se borra a sí mismo (409 CANNOT_DELETE_SELF)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 22. Admin cambia el rol de Ana (200)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/users/2/rol
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "rol": "admin" }